<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><image binderror="imageFailed" bindtap="previewImage" class="detail-image" src="{{product.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="small muted media-caption">{{imageFallback ? '云端图片暂时无法读取，当前展示默认示意图 · 非景泰实拍' : product.imageMediaId ? '商家提供的演示图片 · 点击放大' : '默认示意图片 · 非景泰实拍 · 点击放大'}}</text><button wx:if="{{imageFallback}}" class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">刷新商品图片</button><view class="surface"><text class="eyebrow">{{product.origin}}</text><view class="section-title"><text class="page-title">{{product.name}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="favorite" disabled="{{processing}}">{{favorite ? '已收藏 ♥' : '收藏 ♡'}}</button></view><text class="body-copy">{{product.subtitle}}</text><view class="chips"><text wx:for="{{product.tags}}" wx:key="*this" class="tag">{{item}}</text></view><text class="price large">¥{{variant.priceText}}<text class="small muted"> / {{variant.weight}} · 模拟价格</text></text></view><button class="secondary wide" bindtap="consult">咨询这件好物</button><view class="surface"><text class="heading">选一份合适的规格</text><view class="variant-list"><button wx:for="{{product.variants}}" wx:key="id" class="variant {{variantIndex === index ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseVariant"><text>{{item.label}} · {{item.weight}}</text><text>¥{{item.priceText}} · 余{{item.stock}}份</text></button></view><view class="section-title"><text>购买数量</text><view class="stepper"><button data-delta="-1" bindtap="quantity" disabled="{{quantity <= 1}}">−</button><text>{{quantity}}</text><button data-delta="1" bindtap="quantity" disabled="{{quantity >= 10}}">＋</button></view></view><text class="muted small">{{variant.hint}}</text></view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">看看这份好物</text><text class="body-copy">{{product.summary}}</text><view wx:for="{{product.factRows}}" wx:key="label" class="info-row"><text class="muted">{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.value}}</text></view></view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">{{product.videoTitle}}</text><video wx:if="{{video}}" class="harvest-video" src="{{video}}" controls show-center-play-btn object-fit="contain" binderror="videoFailed"/><view wx:elif="{{videoUnavailable}}" class="video-empty"><text class="quick-symbol">▶</text><text>云端素材暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新重试</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">刷新视频</button></view><view wx:else class="video-empty"><text class="quick-symbol">▶</text><text>采收视频待补充</text><text class="small muted">上传并发布后，这里才会展示对应素材。</text></view><view wx:if="{{videoError}}" class="note"><text>视频暂时无法播放，请检查网络后重新读取。</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh">重新读取视频</button></view><text wx:if="{{video || product.videoMediaId}}" class="small muted media-caption">演示视频 · 由商家提供，暂不代表真实景泰采摘或供货</text><text class="field-label">来源与内容说明</text><text class="body-copy">{{product.videoNote}}</text><view wx:for="{{product.harvestSteps}}" wx:key="title" class="harvest-step"><text class="step-number">{{index + 1}}</text><view><text class="product-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="body-copy">{{item.text}}</text></view></view></view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">保存与批次</text><text class="body-copy">{{product.storage}}</text><text class="body-copy">{{product.sizeNote}}</text><text class="small muted">模拟批次：{{product.stock.batchCode || '尚未配置'}}</text><text wx:if="{{product.stock.harvestDate}}" class="small muted">采收日期：{{product.stock.harvestDate}}</text><text class="note">{{product.stock.note || '规格及品质说明均为模拟，不代表真实供货。'}}</text></view><view class="fixed-actions"><button class="secondary" data-page="cart" bindtap="go">购物车</button><button class="primary grow" bindtap="addCart" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing || variant.stock < quantity}}">{{variant.stock < quantity ? '当前规格缺货' : '加入购物车'}}</button></view></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
